{
  "info": {
    "name": "Rumbasha Backend",
    "description": "Collection API Rumbasha Backend.\n\n## Cara pakai\n1. Jalankan server: `make run` (default http://localhost:8080). Ubah variable `base_url` kalau port/server berbeda.\n2. Pastikan data dummy sudah diisi: `make seed` (password semua akun: `password123`).\n3. Jalankan salah satu request **Login**. Access token & refresh token otomatis tersimpan di variable collection, jadi request lain langsung memakai akun itu.\n\n## Variable\n- `base_url`: alamat server\n- `username` / `password`: akun untuk request **Auth > Login**\n- `access_token`, `refresh_token`: diisi otomatis setelah login/refresh, dikosongkan setelah logout\n- `subject_id`: diisi otomatis setelah **Subject > Tambah subject**\n\n## Catatan sesi\nAccess token berlaku 15 menit; kalau habis (401), jalankan **Auth > Refresh token**. Semua sesi berakhir setiap tanggal 1 jam 00:00 WIB, setelah itu wajib login ulang.\n\n## Menjalankan otomatis dengan Postman CLI\n```\npostman collection run docs/postman/Rumbasha.postman_collection.json -i \"Auth\" -i \"Login per role (akun dummy)\"\n```",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      { "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
    { "key": "username", "value": "admin.sbytimur" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "password123" },
    { "key": "access_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "refresh_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "subject_id", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Cek server",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/health",
            "description": "Cek apakah server hidup. Tidak perlu login."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Login, data user, refresh, dan logout. Jalankan berurutan dari atas.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login",
            "description": "Login dengan username + password (variable `username` & `password`).\n\nToken dari response otomatis disimpan ke variable `access_token` dan `refresh_token`.\n\n`refresh_token_expires_at` = akhir sesi, selalu tanggal 1 bulan berikutnya jam 00:00 WIB."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "// Simpan token supaya request lain langsung memakainya.",
                  "const data = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', data.access_token);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', data.refresh_token);",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('sesi berakhir tanggal 1 jam 00:00 WIB', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(data.refresh_token_expires_at).to.match(/-01T00:00:00\\+07:00$/);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Data user yang login (me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/me",
            "description": "Data user yang sedang login. Wajib login.\n\nUntuk siswa, `access` berisi paket yang aktif HARI INI dan fitur yang terbuka (`features`). Untuk admin/tutor, `access` bernilai null."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "const data = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "pm.test('tidak mengirim password', () => pm.expect(data.user).to.not.have.property('password_hash'));",
                  "",
                  "if (data.user.role === 'student') {",
                  "  pm.test('siswa punya data akses fitur', () => pm.expect(data.access.features).to.be.an('object'));",
                  "} else {",
                  "  pm.test('admin/tutor tidak punya data akses paket', () => pm.expect(data.access).to.be.null);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh token",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refresh_token\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/refresh",
            "description": "Tukar refresh token dengan pasangan token baru. Dipakai saat access token habis (401).\n\nRefresh token sekali pakai: token lama langsung tidak berlaku. Akhir sesi tidak ikut diperpanjang."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "const data = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "pm.test('refresh token baru berbeda', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(data.refresh_token).to.not.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('refresh_token'));",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', data.access_token);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', data.refresh_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refresh_token\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/logout",
            "description": "Tutup sesi. Setelah ini refresh token tidak bisa dipakai lagi. Token di variable dikosongkan."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', '');",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', '');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Me tanpa login (harus 401)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/me",
            "description": "Contoh request tanpa token: ditolak dengan 401."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
